# Vercel serves this repo as static files, so anything left here is
# downloadable by anyone. The PHP backend runs on separate hosting and
# has no business being published as source: a request for
# /api/download.php on the site returned the file itself, which is how
# buyers ended up downloading download.php instead of their PDF.
api/

# The paid products. Never serve these from the site.
Products/

# Server setup notes, not a page.
SETUP-PHP.md
